r Straße</span><span style=" font-size:10pt;"> - Rosenthaler Straße - Hackescher Markt - &upNeue Promenade - &upKleine Präsidentenstraße - Oranienburger Straße - Oranienburger Tor - Friedrichstraße - Am Weidendamm - Planckstraße - &upClara-Zetkin-Straße - &upGeorgenstraße -</span><span style=" font-size:10pt; font-weight:600;"> Am Kupfergraben</span></p></td></tr></table>\u000a<p align="justify" style="-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:10pt;"><br /></p></body></html>'),0,0,'2012-07-01 13:56:49');
INSERT INTO Comments VALUES(470,'','1131','1988/08/20','["10E"]',unistr('<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd">\u000a<html><head><meta name="qrichtext" content="1" /><style type="text/css">\u000ap, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\u000a</style></head><body style=" font-family:''Ubuntu''; font-size:11pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;">\u000a<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-size:12pt; font-weight:600;">20.08.1988</span><br />Inbetriebnahme Strecke Prerower Platz - Falkenberg</p>\u000a<p style="-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><br /></p>\u000a<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-size:-1.5pt; color:#ff0000;">entfällt</span></p></body></html>'),0,0,'2012-07-01 13:56:49');
INSERT INTO Comments VALUES(471,unistr('20.08.1988\u000aInbetriebnahme Strecke Prerower Platz - Falkenberg\u000a'),'15','1988/08/20','["15"]',unistr('<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd">\u000a<html><head><meta name="qrichtext" content="1" /><style type="text/css">\u000ap, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\u000a</style></head><body style=" font-family:''Ubuntu''; font-size:11pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;">\u000a<p style=" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-size:12pt; font-weight:600;">20.08.1988</span><br />Inbetriebnahme Strecke Prerower Platz - Falkenberg<br /></p>\u000a<table border="0" style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;" width="834" cellspacing="2" cellpadding="0">\u000a<tr>\u000a<td colspan="2" style=" vertical-align:top;">\u000a<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><img src="http://www.berlin-straba.de/images/Neubautrassen/1988-08-20_Falkenberg_800px.jpg" width="800" height="119" style="vertical-align: top;" /></p>\u000a<p style="-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><br /></p>\u000a<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; color:#ff0000;">Falkenberg</span><span style=" font-size:10pt; color:#ff0000;"> - Falkenberger Chaussee - Prerower Platz</span></p>\u000a<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-size:10pt; color:#ff0000;"> - Rüdickenstraße - Gehrenseestraße - Hauptstraße - </span></p>\u000a<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-size:10pt; color:#ff0000;">Konrad-Wolf-Straße - Hohenschönhauser Straße - Oderbruchstraße - Leninallee - Langenbeckstraße - </span><span style=" font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; color:#ff0000;">Leninallee/Dimitroffstraße</span></p>\u000a<p style="-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; color:#ff0000;"><br /></p>\u000a<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-size:9pt; font-style:italic;">Wegen Gleisarbeiten auf dem Streckenabschnitt </span></p>\u000a<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-size:9pt; font-style:italic;">Prerower Platz - Zingster Straße, wurde der Neubauabschnitt</span></p>\u000a<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-size:9pt; font-style:italic;"> Prerower Platz - Falkenberg  vom 08.08. bis 12.08.1988 und</span></p>\u000a<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-size:9pt; font-style:italic;"> vom 15.08. bis 19.08.1988 - jeweils in der Zeit von 08:30</span></p>\u000a<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-size:9pt; font-style:italic;">Uhr bis 13:30 Uhr - bereits von den Linien 16, 28, 63 und 70, </span></p>\u000a<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-size:9pt; font-style:italic;">ohne Fahrgäste, befahren. Diese Fahrten dienten zur </span></p>\u000a<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-size:9pt; font-style:italic;">Streckeneinweisung des Fahrpersonals. </span></p>\u000a<p align="justify" style=" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-size:9pt; font-style:italic;">Zur Eröffnung der Strecke nach Falkenberg sollte anstelle der Linie 58 eine Linie 74 zwischen Falkenberg und Bornholmer Straße in Betrieb genommen werden, was aber nie geschah. In einigen alten Stadtplänen aus dem Jahre 1987/88 ist die Linie 74 zum Teil mit eingezeichnet gewesen.</span></p></td></tr></table></body></html>'),0,0,'2012-07-01 13:56:49');
